<title>USA: AmeriQuest Q2 loss widens after charges.</title>
<headline>AmeriQuest Q2 loss widens after charges.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Fla. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands)</p>
<p>				     Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net sales			  $75,295	$108,499</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     (33,101)	 (5,714)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share     (0.49)	  (0.20)</p>
<p> Avg # shares		  66,881,906    28,124,369</p>
<p>NOTES: Six-month data were not given.</p>
<p>Loss for 1997 Q2 includes restructuring charges and provisions relating to the restructuring of $25 million and $2 million of restructuring costs and provisions recorded earlier in operating results.</p>
<p>Full company name is AmeriQuest Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610 ))</p>
